From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: mdlstl maintainers <maintainers@mdlstl.local>
Date: Fri, 25 Sep 2026 12:00:00 +0000
Subject: Support opt-in Clearcote WebRTC address overrides

Electron-specific opt-in fingerprint controls require native Blink/content
hooks; JavaScript overrides cannot implement these engine surfaces. Ported
from Clearcote 9ac88dbb2f60340ecf49731f63fe8e04040754bb (Chromium 149)
to Electron's patched Chromium 150.0.7871.250. Retain Chromium 150 buffer
tracking/audio locking, adapt strict buffer checks, and gate persona overrides.

Upstream: https://github.com/clearcotelabs/clearcote-browser
Licenses and exact provenance: electron/patches/clearcote/
Maintenance: replay after Electron patches, compile affected translation units,
run clearcote_core_tests, and run script/clearcote/smoke.cjs on the rebuilt app.

